# tests/app1.script (make test-app, tests/app.sh): XCOM.HZA installed from the Desktop
# (--mode none: Files open at the card's root), started from Programs > Games WITHOUT the
# game's data: the program must say so on its screen and end at a key.
1000 xcom\n
+0 wait install: asks:
+800 shot
+500 \n
+0 wait install: installed /APPS/XCOM
+800 \n
# (the Desktop reads the new Programs list from the card: on the board's card a few
# seconds after the install)
+6000 {f10}
+400 {right}
# (the Programs menu checks each program on the card as it opens: about 2 s on the
# board's card, and the Games menu again)
+3000 {end}
+400 \n
+3000 shot
+400 \n
+0 wait xcom: message: Press a key
+1500 shot
+500 {space}
